  AppStream metainfo for Plainnote. Read by Flatpak (mandatory),
  GNOME Software, KDE Discover, and AppStream-aware launchers.

  Validate locally with:
    flatpak run --command=appstream-util org.freedesktop.Sdk//24.08 \
      validate-relax packaging/flatpak/dev.plainnote.app.metainfo.xml
